102	  // re-enforce the mcp:read scope here — but only for MCP token callers
103	  // (oauth/pat). Session/anonymous/system callers carry no MCP scope dimension
104	  // (they're gated by member role + public-readability at the query level), which
105	  // mirrors how extractAuthContext assigns scopes: real scopes for oauth/pat, a
106	  // not-applicable sentinel otherwise.
