1	/**
2	 * Streamable HTTP MCP transport handler.
3	 *
4	 * Uses the official MCP SDK's low-level Server + WebStandardStreamableHTTPServerTransport
5	 * so that Codex CLI (rmcp) and other 2025-03-26 clients can connect.
6	 *
7	 * We use the low-level Server (not McpServer) because our tools use TypeBox
8	 * JSON Schemas, while McpServer.registerTool expects Zod schemas.
9	 *
10	 * Sessions are kept in-memory for active transports and persisted in PostgreSQL
11	 * so authenticated sessions can recover across restarts and replica hops.
12	 */
